warsi (0.10.1~git20261115.ba13800e-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rename the package to warsi: the BlankOn fork is rebranded as Warsi
    (app ID id.blankonlinux.warsi), based on Bazaar. New snapshot from
    github.com/BlankOn/bazaar main at ba13800e (upstream GNOME World/bazaar
    9560ad18, plus the downstream "APT system updates" and "Warsi rebrand"
    patches, see ai-patches/PLAN.md).
  * Desktop notifications for pending Flatpak and APT updates; install the
    system autostart file etc/xdg/autostart/warsi.desktop.
  * Installed names follow the rebrand: /usr/bin/warsi{,-daemon,-dl-worker},
    id.blankonlinux.warsi.* data files, warsi.mo translations. No file is
    shared with the bazaar package any more, so both can be installed.

